title: NPC2
---
NPC2: This machine doesn't work.
NPC2: Don't you have a mechanic for this sort of thing?
You: No, I'm sorry. It's just me.
NPC2: Still? 
You: I'll take a look at it. Give me one second. 
<<deactivate_npc NPCManager>>

===
title: Rosaline
---
Rosaline: Hey, Casey.
Rosaline: You doing okay by yourself out there?
You: I mean...
    -> Same as always.
    -> That girl...
        Rosaline: What, Penny? Giving you a hard time?
        Rosaline: You gotta cut her some slack.
        Rosaline: You were just as wide-eyed when you were a kid. 
        Rosaline: But I get it. You're bothered.
Rosaline: Sounds tough. Want a drink?
    -> On the clock?
    -> You know I'm not old enough.
Rosaline: Like that's ever stopped anyone.
Rosaline: I'm just kidding. Tom would have our heads.
Rosaline: And then we really wouldn't be able to sell alcohol anymore.
...
Rosaline: Well, hey, it's slowed down.
Rosaline: Wanna do me a favor?
    -> Of course.
    -> I don't have a choice, do I?
Rosaline: That's the spirit. 
Rosaline: I wanna smoke. Mind watching the bar for a few?
    -> Alright.
    -> I don't know how to make drinks.
       Rosaline: We all start somewhere.
       Rosaline: Anyways, it's not so tough.
       Rosaline: The ingredients for each drink are listed on the menu, so...
       Rosaline: If anyone orders anything, just look at that.
Rosaline: Thanks, kid. Be right back.
<<deactivate_npc NPCManager>>
===
title: Tom
---
Tom: Alright, Casey. I'm finished up here for today.
You: Your meeting is today?
Tom: Sure is. The whole thing is just stupid.
Tom: We can't afford their minimum. Even if we could, where the hell are we supposed to store all of that alcohol?
    -> Maybe we don't need to serve alcohol.
      Tom: Sure we do. Where else is anyone supposed to have a drink around here these days?
      Tom: It's damn near the only reason people still show up here. 
    -> Yeah...
Tom: I've tried looking for other suppliers, but...
Tom: Oh, whatever. Watch the floor, kid. 
Tom: A customer needs something, you give it to 'em. Can't lose any more business.
Tom: Rosaline will lock up after you go.
Tom: Best behavior. Seriously.
    -> Loud and clear.
    -> I get it.
Tom: See you tomorrow.

<<deactivate_npc NPCManager>>


